{
 "_doc": "Hostile-input registry, one entry per redaction rule (id = <table>:<name>; env-line, url-cred, entropy-run for the single regexes). The test generators (mod/tests/hostile_gen.ts, tests/hostile_gen.py) derive a worst-case input per rule from its regex source (longest literal words + a class filler, repeated, then a fast-failing tail) and every rule listed here is measured for its scaling exponent. 'units' adds hand-picked repeated units (engine scanners the regex does not describe); 'linear' marks a rule as a pure literal / single-class scan with the reason (not measured). A rule in a table without an entry, or an entry without a rule, fails the test.",
